            "review_text": "BMMO\nBangkok, Thailand56 contributions\n0\nDecent burger. Great value\nOct 2014\nWent to this place based on TA review. This tiny establishment is tucked away backpackers' area but easy to find. The cheese burger I ordered, while nothing compared to top-class burger joints in Bangkok (or even food truck burger), tastes good. But most important of all, the value is great (50k VND for a burger). The owner is also a very nice and accommodating guy. Good place for a quick bite.\nRead more\nWritten October 18, 2014",
