            "review_title": "Review at GoBurger",
            "review_text": "Matthew L\n6 contributions\n0\nBest Budget Burger in Saigon\nSep 2014\nAs an American, it was crucial that I found a good place to get a hamburger during my one month stay in the backpack district. I was skeptical of this place at first because it doesn't look like much from the street, but after giving it a try on a friend's recommendation I found myself coming back two or three times a week. \n\nThe staff was always so friendly and the burger was great. But what kept me coming back was the kebab combo. 50k for a drink, fries, and a huge crispy pita stuffed with a generous serving of delicious kebab meat and toppings.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2014",
